      "$comment": "Nightly, not stable. yt-dlp's stable channel ships every few months while YouTube breaks extractors every few weeks; nightly carries those fixes within days. Measured 2026-07-30: nightly 2026.07.23 vs stable 2026.07.04. For an app whose whole job is downloading, a stale extractor is an outage."
    },
