      "$comment": "The shared build's libraries. ffmpeg and ffprobe each embed the full codec set in a static build (144 MB apiece), so sharing one copy takes the installer from ~120 MB to ~50 MB. On Linux they land in binaries/lib and the spawn sets LD_LIBRARY_PATH; on Windows the DLLs sit next to the .exe, which is where the loader already looks. macOS keeps standalone binaries, so it has no entry here.",
